{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "094d3ed8-4169-833f-80c5-52be5a98402c",
  "created_at": "2026-03-09T11:43:16-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nancy Hazard",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:41:11-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities, water and sewer billing, this is Tony."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:41:15-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Tony, it's Nancy Hazard. So I got my water bill and it's, like, wicked high. Way more than normal."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:41:22-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm sorry about that. Do you know why it jumped? Anything going on at the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:41:28-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, a pipe broke. It was in the wall by the washer, and I got it fixed already. A plumber came and everything. So I wanna know if there's a leak adjustment or something for that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:41:40-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, there's usually a process for that. You'd send in the plumber's invoice or a repair record along with the bill, and the office reviews the extra usage. I can put a note on the account that you're asking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:41:53-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. Please do. And can you email me a duplicate copy of the bill? Mine got kind of soaked in the whole mess, it's basically mush."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:42:03-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. Is there an email on the account, or do you want to give me a new one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:42:10-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Use what's on file. I haven't changed it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:42:14-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll send it to that one. You should see it within the day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:42:20-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Um, one more thing. I work days, so I can't really get down there before you close. Can I pay in person after four thirty, like in the evening? Or is there some other way?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:42:32-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The counter closes with regular hours, so not in the evening. But there's a drop box outside City Hall you can use any time, and you can pay online whenever you want, nights and weekends too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:42:44-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. Online's fine then. I'll just do that once I see the copy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:42:49-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. Just keep your invoice handy for the adjustment, too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:42:54-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, will do. Honestly I gotta get this sorted before Friday. I play euchre every Friday with the same four people, and I do not wanna be sitting there stewing over a water bill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:43:06-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. Well, you'll have the copy today, and hopefully the rest is easy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:43:11-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Thanks, Tony."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:43:13-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Nancy. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
